WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:07.000
Select twelve fictional files and ask local Gemma for a plan.

00:07.000 --> 01:33.000
The local model is planning. This version preserves the original waiting time.

01:33.000 --> 01:39.000
Review the proposed destinations and source quotes. Two unclear files stay for review.

01:39.000 --> 01:43.000
Approve nine moves, then open their history.

01:43.000 --> 01:47.000
Undo the moves and reopen the inbox.

01:47.000 --> 01:51.300
All twelve files are back. Original hashes were verified separately after undo.
